### Test Web PubSub Access Function
### Configure these values from your local.settings.json

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
@operatorSecret = your-operator-secret
@readerSecret = your-reader-secret

### Get operator access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webpubsub-access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "secret": "{{operatorSecret}}",
  "roomId": "test-room-1",
  "userId": "operator-1"
}

### Get reader access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webpubsub-access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "secret": "{{readerSecret}}",
  "roomId": "test-room-1",
  "userId": "reader-1"
}

### Invalid secret (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webpubsub-access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "secret": "invalid-secret",
  "roomId": "test-room-1",
  "userId": "user-1"
}
